{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1534","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. A New Beginning"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Annie has gotten bored of winning every coding contest and farming unlimited rating. Today, she is going to farm potatoes instead."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Annie's garden is an infinite 2D plane. She has $$$n$$$ potatoes to plant, and the $$$i$$$-th potato must be planted at $$$(x_i,y_i)$$$. Starting at the point $$$(0, 0)$$$, Annie begins walking, in one step she can travel one unit "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"right"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"up"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (increasing her $$$x$$$ or $$$y$$$ coordinate by $$$1$$$ respectively). At any point $$$(X,Y)$$$ during her walk she can plant some potatoes at arbitrary points using her potato gun, consuming $$$\\max(|X-x|,|Y-y|)$$$ units of energy in order to plant a potato at $$$(x,y)$$$. Find the minimum total energy required to plant every potato."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that Annie may plant any number of potatoes from any point."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 800\\,000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$n$$$ lines contain two integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le x_i,y_i \\le 10^9$$$), representing the location of the $$$i$$$-th potato. It is possible that some potatoes should be planted in the same location."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the minimum total energy to plant all potatoes."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 1\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 1\n2 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n5 5\n7 7\n4 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n5 1\n4 0\n9 6\n0 2\n10 1\n9 10\n3 10\n0 10\n8 9\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n19\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n1 1\n2 2\n2 0\n4 2\n4 0\n2 0\n0 2\n4 0\n4 2\n5 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In example $$$1$$$, Annie can travel to each spot directly and plant a potato with no energy required."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In example $$$2$$$, moving to $$$(1,0)$$$, Annie plants the second potato using $$$1$$$ energy. Next, she travels to $$$(1,1)$$$ and plants the first potato with $$$0$$$ energy."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1534G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1534/problem/G"}